                        "review": "Couldn't believe this is made by one person! Pretty decent.\nIt's a classic 2D side-scrolling action game. Worth it. \n\nPlayer experience is significantly enhanced after patches.\n\nAnimations are smooth as fk and the Retro artstyle gives it a nice touch, \nreminds me of arcade games back to 90's.\nPlot is interesting enough, Monk's dialouges are quite funny.\nGameplay is solid, the variety of items helps stacking up combos.\nControls feel handy, everyone can grab a gamepad and jump in.\nIt supports local co-op, what else can I complain?.....the camera?..huh\n\nThis game deserves more attention and appreciation.\nHope updates are coming:P\n\n\nThe monk is not in the temple, meet him in the castle !",
